Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.16,0:00:03.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(忆往昔)
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.31,0:00:05.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我现在已经难辨真假了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm having a difficult time figuring out what's real.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.87,0:00:07.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-幻觉吗  -有时我会看见路西法\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hallucinations? - Sometimes I see Lucifer.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.91,0:00:09.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等一下  你不会现在也能看到他吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, are you seeing him right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.70,0:00:11.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让我看看你的手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me see your hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.52,0:00:12.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你受伤的时候我跟你在一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was with you when you cut it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.73,0:00:13.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我给你缝的针\N{\fnArial\fs30}I sewed it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.34,0:00:17.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是真实的\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is real.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.91,0:00:20.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在炼狱中有着比那些灵魂更加古老的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}There are things much older than souls in purgatory,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.97,0:00:22.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你当时也一并吞下了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you gulped those in, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.93,0:00:24.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-我挡不住他们  -挡住谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I can't hold them back! - Hold who back?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.50,0:00:25.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,利维坦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Leviathan!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.36,0:00:30.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那些  不管是什么东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those... whatever-you-call-'ems...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.44,0:00:31.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,利维坦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Leviathan.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.27,0:00:32.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.41,0:00:32.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果他们进入了水管\N{\fnArial\fs30}If they're in the pipes,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.50,0:00:34.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就像上了高速  四通八达\N{\fnArial\fs30}they got themselves a highway to anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.51,0:00:38.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,苏福尔斯综合医院出了食人案了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something's eating folks down at sioux falls general hospital.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.27,0:00:39.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只要我们在适当位置安插好人手\N{\fnArial\fs30}A few of us in the right positions,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.54,0:00:41.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,每天都将是饕餮盛宴\N{\fnArial\fs30}and we could feast every single day.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.02,0:00:41.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.62,0:00:43.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们在我家见面吧  我们重新部署\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll meet you at the house. We can regroup.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.67,0:00:44.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这地方被火烧了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That place was torched.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.66,0:00:45.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,干这事的人目的明确\N{\fnArial\fs30}Somebody knew what they were doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.23,0:00:47.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,鲍比\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bobby!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.09,0:00:48.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.57,0:00:54.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,两个男性病人  一个有颅脑损伤\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got two males -- one with a head trauma,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.95,0:00:56.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,另一个胫骨骨折\N{\fnArial\fs30}the other with an open tibia fracture.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.62,0:00:57.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们刚开进苏福尔斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're just pulling in to Sioux Falls.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.16,0:00:59.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,苏福尔斯综合医院吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sioux falls general?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.03,0:01:00.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你得带我们去别的地方  任何地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got to take us somewhere else. Anywhere!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.54,0:01:01.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,求你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.90,0:01:04.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也许我不是真实存在的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, so maybe I'm not real,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.84,0:01:06.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但我哪里也不去  萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I'm not going anywhere, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.49,0:01:09.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小萨姆  别离开我  听见了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sammy? You stay with me, you hear?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.88,0:01:10.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-他癫痫发作  -小萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}- He's seizing. - Sammy!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.47,0:01:14.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(如今)
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.21,0:01:27.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,按住他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold him down.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.26,0:01:31.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,三  二  一  好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Three, two, one, set!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.28,0:01:32.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,护士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nurse!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.65,0:01:35.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,放松点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just relax.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.04,0:01:36.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我现在在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where am I?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.08,0:01:38.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你在医院里\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're at the hospital.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.35,0:01:40.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-哪一家  -苏福尔斯综合医院\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Which one? - Sioux Falls general.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.29,0:01:44.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我弟弟在哪  我们得走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's my brother? We got to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.85,0:01:46.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他的头部受到严重撞击\N{\fnArial\fs30}He bashed his head quite seriously.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.57,0:01:47.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们带他去做核磁共振了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's gone up for an MRI.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.87,0:01:48.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  我得走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. I got to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.98,0:01:50.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,伙计  你的腿这个样子你哪也去不了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not going anywhere on this leg, buddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.77,0:02:19.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(苏福尔斯  综合医院)
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.65,0:02:21.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  不  不\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no, no, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.96,0:02:37.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.19,0:02:44.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你没事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.00,0:02:47.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,鲍比  你还活着啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bobby, you're alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.49,0:02:49.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,废话  你怎么掉地上了\N{\fnArial\fs30}'Course I am. Why are you on the floor?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.07,0:02:53.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们给我打了吗啡  打了很多\N{\fnArial\fs30}They gave me morphine, a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.59,0:02:55.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听着  一个怪物把我腿弄折了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, look, a monster broke my leg.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.82,0:03:01.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等等  你的房子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait...the house.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.85,0:03:03.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们以为你死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We thought you were dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.59,0:03:05.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我没死  至少现在还活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I ain't. Not yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.33,0:03:07.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但我们得逃走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But we got to run.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.78,0:03:09.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这地方不安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}This place ain't safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.53,0:03:11.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's Sam?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.66,0:03:13.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想可能在做头部扫描吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh... Head scan, I think.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.89,0:03:16.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在救护车停靠站等我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Meet me at the ambulance dock, stat.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.19,0:03:18.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-我去找萨姆  -等等  在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'll find Sam. - Wait, where?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.83,0:03:20.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,鲍比  我现在瘸着呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bobby, I'm a gimp.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.06,0:03:32.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想你应该已经安排好咱们的甜点了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've scheduled dessert, I presume?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.29,0:03:39.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.55,0:03:41.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,温彻斯特兄弟吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Winchesters?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.35,0:03:58.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等一下  小伙子  这是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold the phone there, son. Who's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.72,0:04:02.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对  就是这家伙  深度昏迷\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, this is the guy. Coverage lapsed.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.17,0:04:03.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们得送他去郡医院\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're shipping him to county.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.01,0:04:05.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快走吧  病秧子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, sicko.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.99,0:04:08.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等到了安全的地方再治好你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's get you healed up someplace a little safer.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.11,0:04:50.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快点  迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.91,0:04:53.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,妈的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Balls.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.28,0:04:57.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快点  迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.78,0:04:59.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快点  迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, Dean!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.27,0:05:02.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快走  快走  快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go, go, go, go, go, go, go!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.67,0:05:19.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,[邪恶力量 第7季第3集]
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.19,0:05:27.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(蒙大拿州  怀特菲什  三周后)
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.47,0:05:32.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.08,0:05:47.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,伙计  快看里卡多\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dude...Ricardo.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.60,0:05:48.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,发生什么事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.39,0:05:50.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,自杀了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Suicidio.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.84,0:05:54.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,永别了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Adios.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.65,0:05:58.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个应该能让你高兴起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, this ought to cheer you up.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.40,0:06:01.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的宝贝\N{\fnArial\fs30}My baby!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.40,0:06:04.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只等把这烦人石膏卸掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now I just got to get this stupid thing off 
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.14,0:06:05.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我就又能开车了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I can drive again.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.05,0:06:06.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,外面情况怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}So how is it out there?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.75,0:06:09.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很怪很血腥\N{\fnArial\fs30}Weird with a side order of bloody.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.44,0:06:11.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我和几个猎人聊了聊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Talked to a few hunters.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.00,0:06:13.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们也遇到了在那家医院开"小吃部"的\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're running into the same kind of thing
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.83,0:06:15.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那种怪物\N{\fnArial\fs30}that set up shop at that hospital.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.68,0:06:17.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有别忘了我俩差点死在你家\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, and don't forget tried to kill us at your place.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.76,0:06:20.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们一致认为...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, consensus is they're, um,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.45,0:06:21.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们就像易形者\N{\fnArial\fs30}they're like shapeshifters
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.75,0:06:23.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只是更爱吃人肉\N{\fnArial\fs30}only a lot more into eating folk.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.67,0:06:27.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而且没有东西能杀了他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}And nothing can kill 'em.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.96,0:06:29.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是好时光啊  还有什么别的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good times. Anything else?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.92,0:06:31.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有  他们流出的是黑色的胶状物\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yep. They bleed black goo.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.59,0:06:33.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就像从小卡身体里流出的一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like that stuff that came out of Cass --
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.58,0:06:34.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这些从炼狱里跑出来的...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those things from purgatory.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.93,0:06:37.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-叫利维坦  是吧  -对\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Uh...Leviathan. - Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.22,0:06:39.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你那警长朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about those chompers
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.11,0:06:40.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在医院看到的那几个食人族呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}that you and the sheriff saw at the hospital?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.38,0:06:41.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们还在吃人肉汉堡吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}They still making spleenburgers?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.50,0:06:43.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错  打了几个电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, made some calls.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.64,0:06:45.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个医生再也没回来上班\N{\fnArial\fs30}That doctor never showed back up to work.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.65,0:06:47.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有一位护士以及几个管理员\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ditto a nurse and some administrators.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.36,0:06:49.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-你从未离开  -那么他们可能在\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You never left. - So they could be at 
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.44,0:06:50.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,美国的任何一家医院\N{\fnArial\fs30}any hospital in America.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.85,0:06:52.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么想  小萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you think, Sammy?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.32,0:06:55.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sammy?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.44,0:06:58.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.54,0:07:00.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-萨姆  -回家吃饭啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sam... - Hey, ground control!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.84,0:07:01.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.24,0:07:08.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了  我...我在这儿呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. What? I'm -- I'm right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.70,0:07:09.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你没事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.88,0:07:10.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.75,0:07:17.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.34,0:07:20.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,以前的所有资料都化为灰烬\N{\fnArial\fs30}Every last bit of info I ever had burned down,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.96,0:07:23.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-所以...  -这地方呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- So... - What about this place?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.08,0:07:23.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,鲁弗斯没留下什么吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rufus leave anything? 
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.98,0:07:24.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,地下室看过了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you check the basement?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.81,0:07:26.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,C型即食军粮和一堆尘土\N{\fnArial\fs30}C-rations and dust.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.61,0:07:28.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想他好几年都没来过这儿了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think he'd been here in years.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.57,0:07:32.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好了  我得去重整之前的图书馆了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, I got to go round up my old library.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.67,0:07:34.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我记得你说过那些书大部分都只此一本\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought you said most of those books were one-of-a-kind.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.49,0:07:37.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错  所以我才在各处藏匿了副本\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. That's why I stashed copies all over the place.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.39,0:07:41.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, good. Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.70,0:07:45.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那位两腿人士  我们没粮食了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, uh, two-legs. We're fresh out of grub.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.10,0:07:45.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要不你去买点回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Want to make a run?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.95,0:07:47.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.87,0:07:51.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,温柔待她  好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Be careful with her, would you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.65,0:07:52.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}And, uh, Sam?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.90,0:07:54.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.61,0:07:56.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,馅饼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pie.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.88,0:07:57.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还用你说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Obviously.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.12,0:08:05.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-所以  -"所以"什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- So? - "So" What?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.60,0:08:06.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你转移话题前  \N{\fnArial\fs30}Before you bail again, 
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.75,0:08:08.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那边正上演《移魂女郎》呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Girl, Interrupted" over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.60,0:08:08.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.29,0:08:09.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有什么想法吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Any thoughts?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.75,0:08:12.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在我看来他的状态有好转\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looks to me like he's doing better.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.42,0:08:13.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好转  你指什么  居然说好转\N{\fnArial\fs30}Better? What do you mean, better? 
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.75,0:08:14.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,刚才你不也看见了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You just saw him!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.30,0:08:15.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看见他只走神了一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}Saw him check out once.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.89,0:08:17.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-可喜的进步  -你开玩笑吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That's progress. - You're kidding!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.81,0:08:20.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得萨姆的大脑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, seems to me that Sam's head
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.29,0:08:22.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,和你的伤腿并无两样\N{\fnArial\fs30}ain't no different than your leg.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.17,0:08:23.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,伤口愈合总有个过程\N{\fnArial\fs30}People heal on a curve.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.72,0:08:24.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,并无两...鲍比  \N{\fnArial\fs30}Not diff-- Bobby, 
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.63,0:08:26.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,五天后我摆脱这玩意儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}I get this thing off in five days,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.29,0:08:27.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,能完好如初\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm golden.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.27,0:08:28.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆那不叫过程\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam's not a curve.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.27,0:08:29.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他就是个定时炸弹\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's a frickin' time bomb.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.39,0:08:31.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他又没在隐瞒什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}It ain't like he's keeping secrets.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.25,0:08:32.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,眼见为实\N{\fnArial\fs30}What you see is what you get.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.73,0:08:35.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,称其为进步又有什么好大惊小怪的\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's so nuts about calling it an upswing?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.75,0:08:38.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为这行不通  鲍比  一向如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because that's not how it works, Bobby, ever!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.29,0:08:40.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吗  尤其是在萨姆身上\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right? Especially not with Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.03,0:08:42.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他早晚会出事\N{\fnArial\fs30}The other shoe is gonna drop.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.20,0:08:43.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-就是个早晚的事  -行\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's just a matter of when. - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.96,0:08:46.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们还是先考虑眼下的事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}How 'bout we worry about today's problems?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.18,0:08:48.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,眼下  我们急需情报\N{\fnArial\fs30}And today, we need intel.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.51,0:08:51.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我去找  你坐这儿杞人忧天吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm going. You sit there and stew.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.35,0:08:52.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我会打电话来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll check in.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.30,0:08:58.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听着  你坐在这干着急\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look...You sitting here wringing your hands
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.60,0:08:59.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也没有任何用处\N{\fnArial\fs30}ain't gonna do nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.52,0:09:02.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也许他会让你刮目相看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe he'll surprise you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.47,0:09:29.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(冰锥杀手重现江湖)
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.38,0:09:38.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,报纸也要吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Paper, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.85,0:09:40.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的  来一份\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, yeah. Yeah, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.31,0:09:44.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,给\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.93,0:09:47.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(莱米·凯尔密斯特)
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.47,0:09:54.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好的  先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.98,0:09:57.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,您在账单上还发现了其他的异常款项吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you see any other strange charges on your statement?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.92,0:09:59.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,比如5月27日的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The May 27th charge to 
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.34,0:10:01.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,, 《玛格达情妇》\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Mistress Magda", perhaps?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.96,0:10:04.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉  得罪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh. Sorry for asking.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.45,0:10:05.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(交易警告  莱米·凯尔密斯特  蒙大拿州  怀特菲什市)
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.50,0:10:08.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们待会再给您打过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're gonna have to call you back.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.12,0:10:18.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有事吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.99,0:10:19.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.99,0:10:22.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的监控程序发现了一个温彻斯特兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Winchesters have triggered one of my search programs.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.06,0:10:23.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Great.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.72,0:10:24.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,蒙大拿州的一家小店\N{\fnArial\fs30}A shop in Montana,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.35,0:10:26.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,离这儿大概一天半  或许两天的车程\N{\fnArial\fs30}about a day and a half, maybe two days from here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.25,0:10:27.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}So?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.05,0:10:29.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后\N{\fnArial\fs30}So?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.60,0:10:31.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么还在和我通话\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, why are you still talking to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.76,0:10:39.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-谢谢  -不客气\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Ah, thank you. - Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.12,0:10:42.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,鲍比去哪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's Bobby?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.71,0:10:44.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-他走了  -是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- He take off? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.41,0:10:47.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆  你状态如何\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Sam, how're you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.60,0:10:50.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.66,0:10:54.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你还会...\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, you still, you know...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.69,0:10:59.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我...我知道你的意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, no, I-I know what you mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.57,0:11:04.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错  我仍然能看见烂七八糟的幻象\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I'm -- I'm still seeing crap that's not real.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.30,0:11:06.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但我没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}But, yeah, I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.06,0:11:07.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我能看出真伪\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, I can tell the difference.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.73,0:11:11.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,感觉有好转吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Think it's getting better?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.17,0:11:14.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说实话吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Honestly? Uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.93,0:11:16.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,其实我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.36,0:11:20.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只知道我应付得来  所以...\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just know I'm managing it, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.16,0:11:21.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以不必担心\N{\fnArial\fs30}So don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.17,0:11:30.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,馅饼呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's the pie?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.73,0:11:33.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我买了蛋糕\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got cake.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.34,0:11:35.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,差不多了  不是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's close enough, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.84,0:12:00.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(疑似"冰锥杀手"所害  警方正调查中\N死者致命伤口即凶手"标志")
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.81,0:12:05.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.81,0:12:05.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错  依我之见\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, so, from what I can tell,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.07,0:12:08.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,应该是妖狐所为\N{\fnArial\fs30}it's something called a Kitsune.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.55,0:12:10.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有很大区别\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not much.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.16,0:12:11.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们...长得像人类...\N{\fnArial\fs30}They...look human...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.21,0:12:13.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过他们会生出利爪\N{\fnArial\fs30}till they sprout out claws
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.38,0:12:15.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,从你耳后刺入以吸食大脑\N{\fnArial\fs30}and stab you behind your ear to get to your brain.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.91,0:12:20.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我...我还不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't -- I don't know yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.33,0:12:23.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错  迪恩  我知道杀死他们很重要\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, Dean, I realize killing 'em's important.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.96,0:12:25.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也许鲍比叔叔能给一本用英语写的书\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe if Uncle Bobby sent a book in english.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.04,0:12:27.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我有\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.31,0:12:30.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  别...别让他接电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, don't -- don't put him on the phone.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.58,0:12:32.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi, Dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.53,0:12:36.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.00,0:12:38.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道死人了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I realize people are dying.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.44,0:12:42.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好  我现在就去图书馆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I'm on my way to the library right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.16,0:13:22.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对不起  亲  涨价了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry, honey. Price went up.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.18,0:13:24.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,55块\N{\fnArial\fs30}$55.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.49,0:13:36.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我钱不够\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I don't -- I don't have it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.90,0:13:37.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真可惜\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's too bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.20,0:13:40.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,或许我们可以做个交易\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe we can make a little trade.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.89,0:14:42.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(过几天就回来  我很好  萨姆)
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.66,0:14:46.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,出事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Other shoe!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.91,0:14:47.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谁出事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Other who?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.13,0:14:49.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆  他走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam. He took off.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.45,0:14:51.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,去哪儿了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.02,0:14:52.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不知道  不是什么好地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know. Nowhere good.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.23,0:14:54.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,或许他只想一个人静静\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, maybe he needed a little "Me-time."
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.32,0:14:56.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他可不是一个人在静静\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, but his me-time ain't just him.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.43,0:14:57.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就现有情况来看\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, for all we know
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.17,0:14:59.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他可能带着路西法一起上路了呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}he's road trippin' with lucifer somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.43,0:15:02.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,留我一个人傻乎乎地呆在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Left me here like Jimmy friggin' Stewart.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.39,0:15:04.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-我猜你打过他电话了  -语音信箱\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I assume you called. - Straight to voicemail.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.48,0:15:06.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他还把GPS给关了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He turned his GPS off, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.10,0:15:07.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还他开走了我的车\N{\fnArial\fs30}And he took my car!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.85,0:15:09.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-淡定  -太晚了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Don't panic. - Too late!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.70,0:15:11.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他说了他没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, he says he's okay,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.02,0:15:13.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那就让他呆上几天\N{\fnArial\fs30}so give it a couple of days.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.14,0:15:15.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等你拆了石膏\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just till you get the cast off --
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.17,0:15:17.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再把他抓回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then hunt him down.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.15,0:15:20.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这几天继续给他打电话就是了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Till then, we'll both just keep calling.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.57,0:15:21.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.99,0:15:29.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你可以退休了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're goin' down.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.19,0:15:37.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们觉得这又是另一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}You guys thinking this is another one --
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.68,0:15:38.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,冰锥杀手做的案吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}so-called ice pick killer? 
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.06,0:15:40.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,同样手法\N{\fnArial\fs30}Same M.O.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.19,0:15:42.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过那家伙死了也好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can't say I'm too broken up about this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.03,0:15:42.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你认识他吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, you knew him?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.73,0:15:44.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,逮了他不知道多少次了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Busted him half a dozen times.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.20,0:15:46.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-大好人啊  -那现在的情况是\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Real mensch. - So, what's the deal?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.68,0:15:49.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杀手来镇上  杀几个混混然后走人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um, killer comes to town, ganks a lowlife, moves along?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.70,0:15:50.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,差不多\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looks like.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.57,0:15:52.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,死者的伤口都是一样的是吗  都在耳朵后面\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stabs 'em all exactly the Same, right? Behind the ear?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.88,0:15:54.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错  变态杀人狂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. No explaining a psycho.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.69,0:15:57.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们没有在报纸上公布细节\N{\fnArial\fs30}We left that detail out of the paper, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.10,0:15:58.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么知道的\N{\fnArial\fs30}How'd you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.19,0:16:01.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我几年前查过类似的案子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I worked a case like this a few years back.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.18,0:16:02.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,觉得有联系吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Think it's related?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.93,0:16:05.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,死者的大脑有没有什么蹊跷\N{\fnArial\fs30}You find anything weird about the brains?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.22,0:16:07.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,比如\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like what?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.33,0:16:08.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大脑丢失\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like...Missing.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.26,0:16:11.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,去问问验尸官吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Huh. Good question for the coroner.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.13,0:16:13.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好的  谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right. Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.45,0:16:19.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(三个未接来电)
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.09,0:16:37.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你好\N{\fnArial\fs30}How you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.83,0:16:40.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,昨天有没有来过一个大个子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, was there a, uh, big guy in here yesterday?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.73,0:16:42.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,多了去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's specific.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.21,0:16:45.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的意思是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, I mean big.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.91,0:16:47.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,跟姚明那么高\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like about yea high?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.87,0:16:48.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好像有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.91,0:16:51.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-棕色头发吗  -是的  就是他\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Uh, brown hair? - Yes, yes. That's him.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.30,0:16:52.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你还记得他买了什么吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you, uh -- you remember what he bought?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.83,0:16:54.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,零食吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Snacks, maybe?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.61,0:16:57.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,买没买报纸  还有昨天的报纸吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}How about a paper? Do you have yesterday's paper?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.82,0:17:05.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(冰锥杀手重现江湖)
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.83,0:16:58.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有  那儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, right there.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.09,0:17:09.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不介意吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you mind?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.80,0:17:14.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们这儿很少有凶杀案\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't get too many murders out this way...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.10,0:17:17.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别说连环杀人了\N{\fnArial\fs30}...much less a serial.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.36,0:17:19.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-你们有什么发现吗  -该问我没发现什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- So what'd you find? - It's what we didn't find.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.80,0:17:20.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你看这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me show you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.47,0:17:24.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很大一部分的中脑丢失了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Big chunk of mid-brain went missing.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.98,0:17:28.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,中脑  脑垂体那块吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mid-brain, like pituitary gland?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.76,0:17:31.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,事实上  他们的脑垂体都被挖走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Actually, their pituitaries were clear gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.95,0:17:32.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是怎么知道的\N{\fnArial\fs30}How'd you know that?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.78,0:17:36.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的  他们需要定期\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, so, they need a steady diet of 
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.52,0:17:38.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,吃人类的脑垂体才能生存\N{\fnArial\fs30}human pituitary glands to survive.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.49,0:17:40.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,推理\N{\fnArial\fs30}Educated guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.71,0:17:50.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等等  慢点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hang on. Slow down.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.59,0:17:55.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.07,0:17:58.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,死者都是在离高速不远的停车场被发现的\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, the victims are located in parks just off the highway.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.11,0:18:01.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,每个镇各一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just one per town.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.14,0:18:03.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有古怪\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's something.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.06,0:18:05.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.45,0:18:07.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我累死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I-I'm just tired.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.46,0:18:09.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我看这些资料已经很久了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been looking at this for like eight years.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.87,0:18:12.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait. Hang on.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.05,0:18:14.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我马上打回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll call you right back.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.19,0:18:47.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一杯焦糖玛奇朵\N{\fnArial\fs30}Triple red eye, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.84,0:18:49.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.75,0:18:59.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你的焦糖玛奇朵\N{\fnArial\fs30}Triple red eye.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.98,0:19:01.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.56,0:20:04.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你对着心脏扎下去\N{\fnArial\fs30}You stab it in the heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.48,0:20:07.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,扎心脏\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stab it in the heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.34,0:20:11.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我说  你刺他的心脏啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}I said, you stab it in the heart!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.43,0:20:16.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好了  你们没事了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. Are you guys cool?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.25,0:20:18.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让我做五分钟正常人可以吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can I have a normal life for five minutes now?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.25,0:20:21.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.12,0:20:23.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快问快答\N{\fnArial\fs30}Quick question --
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.49,0:20:25.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么和女生搭讪\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do you talk to girls?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.99,0:20:43.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只是想\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just wanted to, you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.93,0:20:45.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-跟你问个好  -不\N{\fnArial\fs30}- say hi and... - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.05,0:20:46.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,走开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go away.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.71,0:20:54.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不能跟男生说话\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just, I'm not supposed to talk to boys.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.71,0:21:25.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,走开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Leave me alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.80,0:21:27.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-得了吧  我们说说话嘛  -我要走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Come on. We just want to talk. - I have to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.15,0:21:29.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么这么没礼貌\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why so rude?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.00,0:21:30.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别碰我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't touch me!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.73,0:21:33.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-给我客气点  -为什么你不客气点\N{\fnArial\fs30}-Hey. I said be nice. - Why don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.06,0:21:34.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,滚开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Butt out.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.38,0:21:36.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这小子真找揍\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you believe this guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.01,0:21:52.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你好  我叫萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi. I'm Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.71,0:21:54.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是艾米\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm Amy.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.96,0:22:20.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,见鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.12,0:22:32.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你好  艾米\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi, Amy.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.13,0:22:40.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.10,0:22:44.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.57,0:22:47.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只是  做梦都没想到会再见到你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just...never thought I'd see you again.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.89,0:22:50.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-你来这里做什么  -你应该清楚啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What are you doing here? - I think you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.95,0:22:52.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你长高了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got tall, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.96,0:22:55.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这会儿还跟我拉家常吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Small talk? Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.35,0:22:57.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们边走边聊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's take a walk.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.07,0:22:58.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-萨姆  -走啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sam -- - Walk.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.96,0:23:00.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,同样的手法  同样的猎杀对象\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, Same pattern, same victim pool --
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.97,0:23:02.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,跟我们小时候一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}just like when we were kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.04,0:23:04.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  不是这样  听着  我\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I-it's not what -- look, I'm not --
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.60,0:23:07.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,过去六年我都没换过工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've had the same job for the last six years.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.29,0:23:09.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我有了房子  养了两只猫  还房贷\N{\fnArial\fs30}I-I have a house, two cats, a mortgage.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.74,0:23:10.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我过着正常的生活\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have a normal life.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.79,0:23:12.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你管这叫正常\N{\fnArial\fs30}You call this normal?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.84,0:23:16.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,准备好看医生了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ready to play doctor?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.40,0:23:22.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你要不要告诉我\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, you gonna tell me?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.80,0:23:23.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.13,0:23:26.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是怎么打趴那些家伙的\N{\fnArial\fs30}How you kicked the crap out of those guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.15,0:23:26.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是说\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.81,0:23:29.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我说了你别生气  你有点...\N{\fnArial\fs30}no offense, but you're kind of...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.59,0:23:30.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,瘦巴巴的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wiry?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.32,0:23:32.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.96,0:23:33.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那么\N{\fnArial\fs30}So...?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.56,0:23:36.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我看了很多李小龙的电影\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just watch a lot of Bruce Lee movies.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.44,0:23:41.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喝水吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You thirsty?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.94,0:23:42.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.95,0:23:50.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你住在附近\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, you live around here?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.90,0:23:52.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不算\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, not really.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.20,0:23:54.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,歌不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a cool song.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.83,0:23:57.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我爸只听1979年\N{\fnArial\fs30}My dad doesn't listen to anything
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.02,0:23:59.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,以前的唱片  所以...\N{\fnArial\fs30}recorded after 1979, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.27,0:24:01.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以你也不能听别的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Does that mean you can't?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.96,0:24:03.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我很多时候都待在车里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm kind of stuck in the car a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.90,0:24:05.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我爸总是旅行  因为工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}My dad has to travel. For work.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.75,0:24:07.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我妈带着我也是经常漂来漂去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, me and my mom bounce around a lot, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.82,0:24:10.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她喜欢那种"让风指引我们的方向吧"\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's all about, like, "Letting the wind be our guide."
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.51,0:24:11.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嬉皮士那样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like a hippie?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.05,0:24:13.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不包括和平与爱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Minus the peace and love.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.83,0:24:22.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们总是在路上\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're always on the road.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.62,0:24:25.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,比如世界上最大的麻线团(位于明尼苏达州)吧  我见过两次\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, I've seen the world's biggest ball of twine twice.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.62,0:24:25.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.88,0:24:27.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我见过三次  其实没那么大\N{\fnArial\fs30}Three times. Not that big.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.66,0:24:28.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可不是嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.86,0:24:30.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好了  老实说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, but be honest --
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.71,0:24:32.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,到处跑的生活没劲透了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, moving all the time sucks.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.41,0:24:33.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,永远是新来的孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're always the new kid,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.99,0:24:37.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而且别人总当你是怪人\N{\fnArial\fs30}and everyone always thinks you're a freak.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.40,0:24:39.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆  你就是怪人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam, you are a freak.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.23,0:24:44.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,吉米·亨德里克斯  还有毕加索也是怪人\N{\fnArial\fs30}But so was, I don't know, Jimi Hendrix and...Picasso.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.68,0:24:46.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}So am I.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.23,0:24:50.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,最牛的人都是怪人\N{\fnArial\fs30}All the coolest people are freaks.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.00,0:24:57.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.44,0:25:01.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是什么人  我控制的了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What I am, I'm managing it.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.18,0:25:04.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这周你戳死了三个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You spiked three guys this week.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.28,0:25:06.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  你不明白  不是这样的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, you don't understand. It's not like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.35,0:25:08.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我  我不是什么杀人狂\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm -- I'm not just some murderer.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.69,0:25:11.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-只是逼不得已  -为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I had to. - Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.59,0:25:13.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不能说\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.44,0:25:16.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我非做不可\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just had to.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.75,0:25:19.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,请你相信我  萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please believe me, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.71,0:25:24.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我做不到  对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't. I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.47,0:25:26.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}So am I.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.49,0:25:47.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他要看的就是这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is the one he asked to see.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.90,0:25:48.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Great, great.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.85,0:25:51.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那我问你  他有没有做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, let me ask you, did he do anything to it?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.15,0:25:54.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有  他只是问了几个\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. He just asked a few questions
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.61,0:25:55.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,关于其他死者的问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}about the other vics --
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.25,0:25:58.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,缺失的脑垂体等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Missing pituitary glands and so forth.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.53,0:26:01.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,该死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Son of a bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.24,0:26:05.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆在追查什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam's chasin' a what?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.85,0:26:07.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,妖狐\N{\fnArial\fs30}A kitsune.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.12,0:26:10.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很少见  老爸和我在98年时抓到过一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's pretty rare. Dad and I hunted one back in '98.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.24,0:26:11.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,想不起来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Vaguely rings a bell.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.60,0:26:13.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,正常  过程不太精彩嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, didn't make our highlight reel.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.40,0:26:15.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  至少我们知道他在忙工作了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, least now we know he's working a job.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.88,0:26:18.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-但为什么玩消失  -想不出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah, but why pull the Houdini act? - Not a clue.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.27,0:26:20.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你追到他了要怎么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you gonna do when you catch up?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.48,0:26:22.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我自有打算\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got a few ideas.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.22,0:26:37.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么找到我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}How did you find me?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.76,0:26:40.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你掉了这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}You dropped this.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.84,0:26:43.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,艾米·庞德\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Amy Pond," Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.96,0:26:45.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,名字很好听\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cute name.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.50,0:26:49.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看来房贷这事儿你没骗人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You weren't kidding about the mortgage.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.91,0:26:50.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.60,0:26:53.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等等  那是新鲜的血\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, that's fresh.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.28,0:26:57.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's not mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.74,0:27:00.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-你又出手了  -你以为我愿意吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- So, you killed again! - You think I wanted to?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.01,0:27:02.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你到底在做什么  最好告诉我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think you better tell me exactly what you're doing,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.09,0:27:04.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,否则不管我愿不愿意都要杀了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}or I have to kill you whether I want to or not!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.12,0:27:05.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不能说\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.08,0:27:08.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-萨姆  你了解我  -我了解过去的你\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sam, you know me. - No, I knew you.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.27,0:27:10.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-那是很久以前了  -不  现在也一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That was a long time ago. - No, you know me.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.48,0:27:14.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你知道我是什么样的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know the kind of person I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.71,0:27:24.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,糟糕\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.31,0:27:25.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对不起  我不是故意的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry. I didn't mean to.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.03,0:27:28.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要知道  如果妈妈看到了会发火的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just, if she sees it, you know, my mom will be so pissed.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.70,0:27:30.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这只是意外\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. It was just an accident.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.31,0:27:32.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊  可她脾气很大\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, well, she has a temper.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.21,0:27:34.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有时候会...没什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sometimes. It's...no big deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.33,0:27:35.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我老爸也一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}My dad does, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.22,0:27:37.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他喝酒的时候最好躲远点\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't want to see him when he's drinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.84,0:27:42.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}My mom...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.81,0:27:45.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得她不是个好人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think she's a good person.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.94,0:27:49.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有时候我觉得自己也不是好人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sometimes I don't think I'm a good person, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.14,0:27:50.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是好人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.35,0:27:51.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别急着下定论\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't be so sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.13,0:27:54.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我见多了坏事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been around enough bad
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.28,0:27:56.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好坏我分得出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}to know good when I see it.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.54,0:28:03.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她为我做好了计划\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just she has this... whole plan for me,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.71,0:28:06.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是  我不想和她一样  明白吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}but...I don't want to be like her, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.01,0:28:08.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也不想变得和我爸一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't want to be like my dad, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.16,0:28:12.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.23,0:28:14.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那就告诉我到底怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}So then tell me what's going on.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.77,0:28:18.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,放下刀子  我就给你看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Drop the knife and I'll show you.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.24,0:28:20.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,先让我看  我再放下刀子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Show me and I'll drop the knife.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.23,0:28:26.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't move.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.03,0:28:39.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是雅各布\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is Jacob...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.15,0:28:41.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的儿子\N{\fnArial\fs30}My son.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.74,0:28:48.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我在这有了生活  萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've built a life here, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.50,0:28:52.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还加入了家长教师联谊会  俗人一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm...In the PTA. I'm boring.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.47,0:28:54.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-但你还在猎食  -猎食死人\N{\fnArial\fs30}- But you're still feeding. - On the dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.52,0:28:56.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我做入殓师\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm a mortician.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.39,0:29:00.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.33,0:29:04.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不算美差  可也有好处\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not sexy, but, you know, health benefits.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.56,0:29:07.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我可以悄悄把我和雅各布的每日所需带回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I quietly take what Jacob and I need.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.85,0:29:08.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有人受伤\N{\fnArial\fs30}No one gets hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.64,0:29:11.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可这样风险也很大\N{\fnArial\fs30}But it can be risky,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.68,0:29:14.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这样喂食  特别是对一个孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}feeding like that, especially for a kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.58,0:29:17.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,雅各布病了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jacob got sick.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.12,0:29:20.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他快死了  唯一抗击病魔的办法就是\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was dying, and the only way to fight it off was --
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.73,0:29:21.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,吃新鲜的人脑\N{\fnArial\fs30}He needed fresh meat.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.68,0:29:22.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,起效了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It worked.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.56,0:29:25.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-吃完上一个  他的烧退了  -艾米\N{\fnArial\fs30}- After the last one, his fever broke. - Amy --
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.92,0:29:27.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-都结束了  -这你无法保证\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's over. - You can't guarantee that.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.49,0:29:29.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我向你保证\N{\fnArial\fs30}I give you my word.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.39,0:29:33.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你再杀了我们又有何益处\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, how is spilling more blood gonna help anyone?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.34,0:29:37.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你还是可以全身而退\N{\fnArial\fs30}You could still walk away from this.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.98,0:29:40.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们都能\N{\fnArial\fs30}We both can.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.99,0:29:44.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.82,0:29:46.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,想想我为你做的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}After what I did for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:49.23,0:29:50.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-艾米  我  -躲起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Amy, I -- - hide! 
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.27,0:29:51.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-怎么了  -快\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What? - Quick!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.71,0:29:56.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,回来了啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.75,0:29:57.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们追上来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They caught up.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.81,0:29:59.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谁追上来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who caught up?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.57,0:30:02.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,开辆烂英帕拉的两个猎人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Couple of pros in a piece-of-crap Impala.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.26,0:30:06.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们马上走\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're leaving.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.98,0:30:08.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}But, mom --
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.03,0:30:09.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我就只说一遍\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm only gonna say this once --
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.84,0:30:12.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我养家糊口  你就乖乖按我说的做\N{\fnArial\fs30}I put the food on this table, so you will do as you are told
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.37,0:30:13.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,否则就等着饿肚子吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}or I will let you starve.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.62,0:30:16.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.31,0:30:20.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你去加油  我来收拾东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gas up the van. I'll pack.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.47,0:30:28.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.35,0:30:39.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,第一次约会还不错吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Awesome first date, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:40.22,0:30:42.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很抱歉要你这样子离开  可是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I'm sorry you got to go like this, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.23,0:30:45.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:46.32,0:30:47.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道我妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I know my mom's --
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.86,0:30:50.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没什么  我该走了  抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I just have to go. I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.14,0:30:58.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那没什么  什么也不是  那是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, that -- that's nothing! That's just...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.58,0:31:01.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-萨姆  -英帕拉上的是我爸爸和哥哥\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sam? - It's my dad and brother in the Impala.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:02.24,0:31:03.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是个怪物\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're a monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.96,0:31:07.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是猎人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're a hunter.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.50,0:31:08.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那\N{\fnArial\fs30}So...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.94,0:31:10.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是要杀了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're supposed to kill me...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:11.20,0:31:12.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也该杀了你吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I'm supposed to kill you?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.30,0:31:18.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也许吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.74,0:31:21.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆  我从没杀过人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam, I've never killed anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.80,0:31:24.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也不想伤害你\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I don't want to hurt you.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.52,0:31:27.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你会伤害我吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you want to hurt me?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:32.00,0:31:32.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.47,0:31:36.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那还不快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then run.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:36.98,0:31:39.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要是我妈发现你  她会杀了你  快跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}If my mom finds you, she'll kill you. Just run.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.23,0:31:41.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拜托了  萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.31,0:32:02.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你好啊  萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Howdy, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.22,0:32:08.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,老规矩  不听哥的话就得挨捶\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, old rule, you still my baby, you get punched
Dialogue: 0,0:32:08.95,0:32:10.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就这么溜走  你脑子在想什么  萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}The hell were you thinking, Sam, running off like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.70,0:32:11.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,据我所知\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, for all I know,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.41,0:32:13.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,撒旦可能又占据你了呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Satan could have been callin' your plays.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.15,0:32:17.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩  我得跟你说多少次  我没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, look, how many times do I have to tell you? I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:17.06,0:32:19.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊  没事  你可是心理健康的形象代言人呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yeah, no, you're a poster boy for mental health.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.27,0:32:20.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你知不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have any idea
Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.80,0:32:23.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我一直在为你担惊受怕  坐立不安\N{\fnArial\fs30}the kind of horror shows I had going on in my head?!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.04,0:32:24.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩  我给你留了字条\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, I left you a note.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:24.96,0:32:26.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,镇上有活儿干\N{\fnArial\fs30}There was a job in town.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:26.36,0:32:27.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一个妖狐\N{\fnArial\fs30}A Kitsune.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.71,0:32:29.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊  是啊  我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, yeah. Know, I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.95,0:32:32.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还一直不接我和鲍比的电话  你倒是给个理由\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you ignore Bobby and I's phone calls why, exactly?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.95,0:32:34.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为我想解决好它\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because I wanted to take care of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:34.63,0:32:36.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我解决了  都处理好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I did. I took care of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.46,0:32:37.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-是吗  -没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Really? - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:38.83,0:32:39.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,尸体在哪儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's the body?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.90,0:32:48.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有尸体\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is no body.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:48.22,0:32:49.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.40,0:32:52.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为我放她走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because I let her go.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:53.58,0:32:54.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.13,0:32:56.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}You what?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:57.00,0:32:58.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.04,0:33:02.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.76,0:33:04.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我就知道你藏着东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}I knew you were hiding something.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:05.27,0:33:06.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,瞧见没  我们每过一个镇子\N{\fnArial\fs30}See, we can never blow town
Dialogue: 0,0:33:06.89,0:33:09.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,艾米都得发发贱\N{\fnArial\fs30}without Amy throwing a bitch-fit.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.36,0:33:13.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,答应乖乖跟我走了啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}So agreeing to go peacefully -- well.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.61,0:33:14.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:14.59,0:33:16.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-他是我的朋友  -不  他不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}- He's my friend. - No, he's not.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.30,0:33:17.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-萨姆  -闭嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sam! - Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:18.43,0:33:20.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你有毛病啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is wrong with you, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.49,0:33:22.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你真就那么蠢吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You that stupid? Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:22.93,0:33:25.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,跟你说过多少次  你不能交朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}I already told you, you cannot have friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:25.79,0:33:27.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这孩子是食物\N{\fnArial\fs30}This kid is food!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:27.25,0:33:28.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:30.90,0:33:32.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,给你点教训\N{\fnArial\fs30}This'll teach you.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.39,0:33:59.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你从没告诉过我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You never told me that.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.17,0:34:03.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我谁都没告诉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I never told anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:04.74,0:34:06.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你能想象的出爸爸会怎么做吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, can you imagine what dad would have done?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:08.18,0:34:09.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你在报纸上看到了那篇报道\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you saw the article in the newspaper,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:09.75,0:34:11.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就匆匆赶来\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you just bolted.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.09,0:34:13.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是我留的烂摊子\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was my mess.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:13.58,0:34:15.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你把她放走就算是收拾干净了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you call letting her go cleaning it up?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:17.02,0:34:20.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩  她为了救我杀了她妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}She killed her own mom, Dean, to save me.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:21.58,0:34:23.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道  萨姆  我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hear you, Sam. I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:24.79,0:34:26.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可看看她都做了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}But look at her now.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.04,0:34:28.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她杀了很多人\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's dropping bodies, man...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:29.56,0:34:30.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以我们就得杀她\N{\fnArial\fs30}which means we got to drop her,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:30.85,0:34:34.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不管她小时候干过多少好事\N{\fnArial\fs30}no matter how many merit badges she racked up when she was a kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:35.10,0:34:36.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很抱歉  但事情就这么简单\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry, but it's that simple.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:39.75,0:34:42.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们的生活中没有简单的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing in our lives is simple.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:44.78,0:34:45.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你得跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have to run.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:49.74,0:34:50.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,艾米\N{\fnArial\fs30}Amy!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:51.54,0:34:52.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你有现钞吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you have cash?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:54.12,0:34:56.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你得赶快坐车离开这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I-I want you on the first bus out of town.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:56.72,0:34:57.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,今晚就走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:57.81,0:34:59.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-那我妈妈...  -我会处理好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What about -- - I'll take care of her.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:00.93,0:35:01.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just go!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:02.99,0:35:04.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,跟我走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:05.48,0:35:06.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们不必孤单\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't have to be alone. 
Dialogue: 0,0:35:06.47,0:35:07.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们可以做一对小怪物  萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can be freaks together, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:09.54,0:35:10.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:12.11,0:35:13.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我做不到\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:15.34,0:35:16.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:17.91,0:35:18.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}So am I.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:23.69,0:35:25.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听我说  哥懂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, man, I get it, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:25.51,0:35:27.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你遇见个姑娘  火花四溅\N{\fnArial\fs30}You meet a girl, you feel that spark --
Dialogue: 0,0:35:27.52,0:35:29.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是无与伦比的美丽  但她是个怪物\N{\fnArial\fs30}there's nothing better. But this freak?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:33.68,0:35:35.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-我不是那个...  -你就是那个意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I didn't mean -- - Yeah, you did.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:36.76,0:35:37.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我注意你看我的眼神了  迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I see the way you look at me, Dean,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:37.83,0:35:41.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好像我是个手榴弹  你就等着我爆炸呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}like I'm a grenade and you're waiting for me to go off.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:41.49,0:35:43.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-萨姆  -我不会爆炸的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sam -- - I'm not going off.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:43.94,0:35:44.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,或许我是个怪物\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I might be a freak,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:44.64,0:35:46.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但这不代表我危险\N{\fnArial\fs30}but that's not the same as dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:47.17,0:35:48.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-我没说  -没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I didn't say -- - It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:49.80,0:35:50.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Say it.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:53.58,0:35:56.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我一直试着变得正常\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've spent a lot of my life trying to be normal,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:57.34,0:35:58.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我这骗谁呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}but come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:59.13,0:36:00.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我就是不正常\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not normal.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:00.95,0:36:02.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看看我做的那些事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at all the crap I've done.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:02.00,0:36:04.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看看我现在  我就是个绝世怪物\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at me now. I'm a grade-A freak.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:05.01,0:36:08.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但我能控制得了  艾米也一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I'm managing it. And so is Amy.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:08.45,0:36:09.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是吗  怎么控制\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is she? How?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:09.94,0:36:11.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她在殡仪馆工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}She works at a damn funeral home
Dialogue: 0,0:36:11.86,0:36:13.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是为了不用去杀人  迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}so she doesn't have to kill anyone, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:14.17,0:36:15.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她已经找到应对的方法\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's figured out how to deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.77,0:36:17.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那么那些死人是怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, well, then explain the bodies.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:18.05,0:36:19.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是为了她\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's done.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:20.40,0:36:22.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她的孩子要死了  迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Her friggin' kid was dying, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:22.98,0:36:24.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果你我是她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Put you or me in her position,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:24.15,0:36:25.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们大概也会这么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}we'd probably do the same thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:27.09,0:36:29.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不信任她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, you don't trust her.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:29.84,0:36:30.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没关系\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:31.38,0:36:32.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,信任我吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trust me.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:36.50,0:36:38.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,求你了  迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:42.09,0:36:43.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:44.89,0:36:46.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你当真\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:47.21,0:36:48.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,早晚得信任你吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got to start sometime, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:56.78,0:36:58.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,波兹曼  没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bozeman. Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.07,0:37:00.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,知道了  谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got it. Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:00.77,0:37:03.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,鲍比的电话  我们今晚在斯波坎市待一宿\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was Bobby. We'll hole up in Spokane tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:03.03,0:37:04.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,明天跟他碰面\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll meet him tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:04.55,0:37:05.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你开车吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why don't you drive?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:07.32,0:37:08.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你还要揍我吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You gonna punch me again?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:31.92,0:37:33.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不如你去登记入住吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, why don't, uh -- why don't you check us in?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:33.81,0:37:34.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我得买点"糖"\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got to hit the candy store.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:35.46,0:37:36.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谨遵医嘱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doctor's orders.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:58.16,0:38:00.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,逃跑的时候  要记着换车牌\N{\fnArial\fs30}Next time you run, you should change your license plates.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:01.17,0:38:03.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不换车牌是很容易被找到的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keeping the same tags makes you easy to track.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:05.37,0:38:07.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-你是...  -我是萨姆的哥哥\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Who -- - I'm Sam's brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:07.24,0:38:09.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是艾米·庞德\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you are Amy Pond,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.05,0:38:12.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,波兹曼市失踪的入殓师\N{\fnArial\fs30}the Bozeman mortician who went missing.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:12.39,0:38:13.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有人在找你\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's people looking for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:14.58,0:38:15.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆让你来的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam sent you?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:15.65,0:38:16.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆不知道我来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam doesn't know I'm here.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:16.98,0:38:19.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但他跟你说了吧  我儿子\N{\fnArial\fs30}But he told you. My son --
Dialogue: 0,0:38:19.29,0:38:22.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道  我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know. I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:24.18,0:38:25.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但人...\N{\fnArial\fs30}But people...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:25.82,0:38:27.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是本性难移的\N{\fnArial\fs30}they are who they are.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:28.59,0:38:30.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不管你多努力去改变\N{\fnArial\fs30}No matter how hard you try,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:30.92,0:38:32.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你改不了你的本性\N{\fnArial\fs30}you are what you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:33.66,0:38:35.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你还会再杀人的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You will kill again.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:35.93,0:38:37.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不会的  我保证\N{\fnArial\fs30}I won't. I swear.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:37.86,0:38:39.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,相信我  我很清楚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trust me, I'm an expert.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:41.35,0:38:43.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,或许再过一年  或许再过十年\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe in a year, maybe 10.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:44.96,0:38:47.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但总有一天你还会杀人\N{\fnArial\fs30}But eventually, the other shoe will drop.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:48.81,0:38:50.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在所难免\N{\fnArial\fs30}It always does.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:56.85,0:38:57.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:22.66,0:39:24.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你能去投奔什么人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got someone you can go to?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:28.68,0:39:29.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你杀过人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You ever kill anyone?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:32.74,0:39:34.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果你杀人了  我会来找你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, if you do, I'll come back for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:36.34,0:39:39.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我将来只会杀你\N{\fnArial\fs30}The only person I'm gonna kill is you.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:44.51,0:39:46.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,过几年再来找我吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, look me up in a few years.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:48.74,0:39:50.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果我能活到那天\N{\fnArial\fs30}Assuming I live that long.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:07.79,0:40:08.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:08.56,0:40:10.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆·温彻斯特绝对来过这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam Winchester was definitely here.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:11.29,0:40:12.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:12.70,0:40:14.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,每个我们掌握的他们的假名\N{\fnArial\fs30}Every alias we have for them,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:14.78,0:40:16.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我会查明他们去了哪儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I'll find out where they went from here.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:17.08,0:40:18.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们只比我早走几天\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm only a couple days behind them.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:19.67,0:40:21.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我先吃顿饭\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just grabbing a bite first.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:27.82,0:40:29.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你知道我发现个什么问题吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you know what I find?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:31.43,0:40:32.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,普通的老头子味道还可以\N{\fnArial\fs30}Plain old people taste fine,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:32.78,0:40:36.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但所有的东西...\N{\fnArial\fs30}but everything is better...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:37.95,0:40:39.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,蘸芝士都更好吃\N{\fnArial\fs30}with cheese.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.60,0:00:01.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,
